<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>{% block title %}Códex Recopilatorio de Aventuras{% endblock %}</title>
    
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 576 512'><path fill='%23D4AF37' d='M249.6 60.1C217.6 28.8 174 12 128 12 57.3 12 0 69.3 0 140v292c0 14.2 13.4 24.8 27.2 21.2 32.5-8.5 72.8-13.2 100.8-13.2 46 0 89.6 16.8 121.6 48.1l11.4 11.1c7.9 7.7 20.5 7.7 28.4 0l11.4-11.1c32-31.3 75.6-48.1 121.6-48.1 28 0 68.3 4.7 100.8 13.2 13.8 3.6 27.2-7 27.2-21.2V140c0-70.7-57.3-128-128-128-46 0-89.6 16.8-121.6 48.1L288 71.2l-38.4-11.1zM256 123v313.2c-29.3-19.1-66-28.2-106.8-24.8-31 2.6-67.6 14.1-93.2 24V140c0-41.9 34.1-76 76-76 34.3 0 65.6 22.8 76.8 55.2 2.5 7.2 9.3 12 17 12h11.2-11.2zm264 21.2v295.4c-25.6-9.9-62.2-21.4-93.2-24-40.8-3.4-77.5 5.7-106.8 24.8V123c0-7.7 6.8-12.5 14.3-13.8 11.2-32.4 42.5-55.2 76.8-55.2 41.9 0 76 34.1 76 76l12.9 14.2z'/></svg>">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <style>
        body {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
        }
        .navbar {
            z-index: 1030;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
        }
        .app-container {
            display: flex;
            flex: 1;
            height: calc(100vh - 56px);
        }
        .sidebar {
            width: 260px;
            background-color: #212529;
            color: #fff;
            overflow-y: auto;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }
        .sidebar .nav-link {
            color: #rgba(255,255,255,.75);
            padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }
        .sidebar .nav-link:hover, .sidebar .nav-link.active {
            color: #F5CF27;
            background-color: #343a40;
        }
        .main-content {
            flex: 1;
            overflow-y: auto;
            padding: 2rem;
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
        }
    </style>
    {% block stylesheets %}{% endblock %}
</head>
<body>

    <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-dark bg-dark">
    <div class="container-fluid">
        <a class="navbar-brand fw-bold" href="{{ is_granted('ROLE_ADMIN') ? path('app_lobby_master') : path('app_lobby') }}">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-dragon text-warning"></i> Códex Recopilatorio de Aventuras
        </a>
        
        <div class="ms-auto d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
            {% if app.user %}
                {% if is_granted('ROLE_ADMIN') %}
                    <a href="/admin/dashboard" class="btn btn-sm btn-warning fw-bold text-dark me-2">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-screwdriver-wrench"></i> Panel Máster
                    </a>
                {% endif %}

                <span class="navbar-text me-2 text-white">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-user-shield text-info"></i> {{ app.user.userIdentifier }}
                </span>
                <a href="{{ path('app_logout') }}" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-danger">Cerrar Sesión</a>
            {% else %}
                <span class="navbar-text me-3 text-muted">Invitado</span>
                <a href="#" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-light">Iniciar Sesión</a>
            {% endif %}
        </div>
    </div>
</nav>

    <div class="app-container">
        
        <aside class="sidebar">
            <div class="p-3 border-bottom border-secondary">
                <small class="text-uppercase text-warning fw-bold">Navegación</small>
            </div>
                <nav class="nav flex-column">
                    <a class="nav-link {% if subseccion is not defined %}active{% endif %}" href="{{ is_granted('ROLE_ADMIN') ? path('app_lobby_master') : path('app_lobby') }}">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-house text-warning"></i> Inicio
                    </a>
                    <a class="nav-link {% if subseccion|default('') == 'mi_personaje' %}active{% endif %}" href="{{ path('app_lobby_mi_personaje') }}">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-user-gear text-primary"></i> Mi personaje
                    </a>
                    <a class="nav-link {% if subseccion|default('') == 'personajes' %}active{% endif %}" href="{{ path('app_lobby_personajes') }}">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-users text-info"></i> Personajes
                    </a>
                    <a class="nav-link {% if subseccion|default('') == 'npcs' %}active{% endif %}" href="{{ path('app_lobby_npcs') }}">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-user-astronaut text-success"></i> NPCs
                    </a>
                    <a class="nav-link {% if subseccion|default('') == 'tiendas' %}active{% endif %}" href="{{ path('app_lobby_tiendas') }}">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-shop text-success"></i> Mercaderes y Tiendas
                    </a>
                    <a class="nav-link {% if subseccion|default('') == 'enemigos' %}active{% endif %}" href="{{ path('app_lobby_bestiario') }}">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-dragon me-1 text-danger"></i> Bestiario y Enemigos
                    </a>
                    <a class="nav-link {% if subseccion|default('') == 'jefes' %}active{% endif %}" href="{{ path('app_lobby_jefes') }}">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-chess-king text-danger"></i> Jefes y enemigos de élite
                    </a>
                    <a class="nav-link {% if subseccion|default('') == 'otras_caracteristicas' %}active{% endif %}" href="{{ path('app_lobby_otrasCaracteristicas') }}">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-dice-d20 text-secondary"></i> Otras características
                    </a>
                </nav>
        </aside>

        <main class="main-content">
            <div class="container-fluid">
                {% block body %}
                    <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded shadow-sm">
                        <h1>¡Bienvenido a tu Universo!</h1>
                        <p class="lead text-muted">El chasis base está listo. El Navbar superior y el Sidebar lateral están fijos y funcionando.</p>
                        <hr>
                        <p>Este espacio central es el contenedor que irá cambiando dinámicamente según la sección en la que hagas click.</p>
                    </div>
                {% endblock %}
            </div>
        </main>

    </div>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
    {% block javascripts %}{% endblock %}
</body>
</html>